["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SupportRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Specifies how an Agent supports a given Artifact. The relationship type shall be\nprovidesSupportFor. The from of the relationship is the Agent providing\nsupport, and the to are the Artifact for which support is being provided.\n\nstartTime and endTime are mandatory when using this class.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nb79707c2a0174fcdb8ca63e213f50102", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetType/text", "globalId", "", ""]
