["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/x509Cert", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A reference to an X.509 certificate as defined in RFC 5280 <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc5280/>. The primary media type shall be application/pkix-cert. The legacy media types application/x-x509-ca-cert and application/x-x509-user-cert may be used for backward compatibility, but shall not be used in new implementations. NOTE \u2014 RFC 5280 supersedes earlier X.509 profiles, including RFC 1422. Existing references based on RFC 1422 remain valid.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ElementCollection", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A collection of Elements, not necessarily with unifying context.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/IsoAutomationLevel/notAutomated", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Level 0 - Not automated. No automation. The operator fully controls the system.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
