["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/devLifecycleStage", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The development lifecycle stage specifies the phase or phases of a product\u2019s lifecycle to which a given requirement applies. These may include requirements that govern the design phase, guide development activities, define constraints for the build environment, provide instructions for the decommissioning phase, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isil", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "International Standard Identifier for Libraries and Related Organizations (ISIL) <https://slks.dk/english/work-areas/libraries-and-literature/library-standards/isil/> is a unique alphanumeric code for identifying libraries, archives, museums, and related organizations standardized by ISO 15511 <https://www.iso.org/standard/77849.html>. It consists of a prefix\u2014which may be an ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code or a non-country code assigned by the ISIL Registration Authority\u2014followed by a unit identifier, totaling up to 16 characters (e.g., FI-Sipoo-S\u00f6 or ZDB-1-SBD). Valid symbols include any alphanumeric character, solidus (/), hyphen-minus (-), or colon.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/CustomLicenseAddition", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A CustomLicenseAddition represents an addition to a License that is not listed\non the\nSPDX License Exceptions <https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html>,\nand is therefore defined by an SPDX data creator.\n\nIt is intended to represent additional language which is meant to be added to\na License, but which is not itself a standalone License.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/PositiveIntegerRange", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class", "globalId", "", ""]
