["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/SoftwareService", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "SoftwareService represents a service based on software components offered for access online over a network.\nThe primary provider of the SoftwareService is the /Core/suppliedBy.\nAny additional providers can use a relationship of relationship type availableFrom.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
