["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibid", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "International Business Identifier (IBID) <https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/> is a verifiable unique identifier for legal entities as defined in the ISO/DIS 25500-3 <https://www.iso.org/standard/87705.html> draft standard. It is composed of three data elements: the International Business Registration Number (IBRN), the legal name, and the date of origin formatted as eight numeric characters (YYYYMMDD). Each element is separated by a pipe character (|) (e.g., US-DE.BER:3031657|Code Management Association|19990420).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
