["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/buildId", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A buildId is a locally unique identifier to identify a unique instance of a\nbuild, according to the buildType.\n\nThis identifier differs based on build toolchain, platform, or naming\nconvention used by an organization or standard.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
