["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/additionalInformationSpecification", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "It is the authoritative or credible entity, document, or body of knowledge that provides the meaning of an additionalInformation key and/or its values, ensuring accuracy, context, and standardization.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
