["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN) <https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan> is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by ISO 15706 <https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html>. The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the \"ISAN\" label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., 000000003A8D000000000000).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResolutionAction", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Products out of specification require a resolution action. This is the action of resolution.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
