["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/listVersionAdded", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A listVersionAdded for a ListedLicense or ListedLicenseException on the\nSPDX License List <https://spdx.org/licenses/>\nspecifies which version release of the License List was the first\none in which it was included.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
