["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/ContentIdentifier", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A ContentIdentifier is a canonical, unique, immutable identifier of the content\nof a software artifact, such as a package, a file, or a snippet.\n\nIt can be used for verifying its identity and integrity.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/ConfidentialityLevelType/amberStrict", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Limited distribution - organization only. The dataset shall be shared only with specific organizations on a need-to-know basis.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
