["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/createdUsing", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "CreatedUsing identifies the tooling that was used during the creation of the\nElement.\n\nThe generation method will assist the recipient of the Element in assessing\nthe general reliability/accuracy of the analysis information.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
